LAN 2 uses 192.168.2.0/24, 2 pcs connected to switch and router 2
The routers are connected using a 1 Gb Ethernet p2p WAN link, network address 192.168.3.0/24.

All devices have a unique IP each, PCs use local router's LAN IP address as their default gateway to communicate with devices on other networks.

b) Draw a network diagram showing all devices and links. 
 
